GNU AGPLv3.

THIRD-PARTY SERVICES
--------------------
amber-ai contacts exactly one network address: the value of AMBER_AI_URL,
which defaults to http://127.0.0.1:11434 -- a model server running on the
same machine. It bundles no model weights, embeds no API key, contains no
telemetry, and has no fallback to any hosted service. Model backends such as
Ollama or llama.cpp are separate programs under their own licences and are
neither included nor required.
